sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Swap page
  participant API as Backend
  participant ZX as 0x API
  UI->>API: GET /api/swap/price
  API->>ZX: indicative price
  ZX-->>UI: rate and route
  UI->>API: GET /api/swap/check-allowance
  UI->>API: GET /api/swap/quote
  UI->>API: POST /api/swap/execute
  API->>API: decrypt key, sign, broadcast
  API-->>UI: transaction hash
